{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "kind": "help-article",
  "title": "Configuring AppProtection Policies Using API",
  "source": {
    "url": "https://help.zscaler.com/legacy-apis/configuring-appprotection-policies-using-api",
    "node": "1485461",
    "revision": "3175632",
    "updated": "2026-01-23",
    "updated_basis": "pdf-last-modified"
  },
  "captured_at": "2026-11-04",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "text": "This article provides information on managing Zscaler Private Access (ZPA) AppProtection policy use cases using APIs. All APIs are rate limited. To learn more, see Understanding Rate Limiting."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Prerequisite API Call",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To get the policySetId by policy type:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Send a GET request to the following endpoint: /mgmtconfig/v1/admin/customers/{customerId}/policySet/policyType/{policyType}.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Provide the policyType, the value for differentiating the policy types, in the request endpoint. The supported values are:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "ACCESS_POLICY or GLOBAL_POLICY (i.e., access policy)",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "TIMEOUT_POLICY or REAUTH_POLICY (i.e., timeout policy)",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "BYPASS_POLICY or CLIENT_FORWARDING_POLICY (i.e., client forwarding policy)",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "INSPECTION_POLICY (i.e., AppProtection policy)",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "ISOLATION_POLICY (i.e., Isolation policy)",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "REDIRECTION_POLICY (i.e., redirection policy)",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "CAPABILITIES_POLICY (i.e., privileged capabilities policy)",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "CREDENTIAL_POLICY (i.e., privileged credential policy)",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "CLIENTLESS_SESSION_PROTECTION_POLICY (i.e., Browser Protection policy)",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "PRIVILEGED_PORTAL_POLICY (i.e., privileged portal policy)",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To get an AppProtection policy set ID, provide the INSPECTION_POLICY policy type in the request endpoint. For example: /mgmtconfig/v1/admin/customers/144118148382064640/policySet/policyType/INSPECTION_POLICY."
    },
    {
      "item": "View an example response",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "{",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"id\":\"144118148382065495\",",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"creationTime\":\"1649873731\",",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"modifiedBy\":\"144118148382065487\",",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"name\":\"Inspection_Policy\",",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"enabled\":true,",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"description\":\"Inspection Policies\",",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"policyType\":\"6\",",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "\"sorted\":true",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "}",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "A successful response returns code 200. To learn more, see API Response Codes and Error Messages."
    },
    {
      "text": "To get the paginated policy rules for the specified policy type:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Send a GET request to the following endpoint: /mgmtconfig/v1/admin/customers/{customerId}/policySet/rules/policyType/{policyType}?page=1&pagesize=20.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Provide the following in the request endpoint:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2
    },
    {
      "item": "customerId: The ZPA tenant ID of the customer.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "policyType: The value for differentiating the policy types. The supported values are:",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "ACCESS_POLICY or GLOBAL_POLICY (i.e., access policy)",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "TIMEOUT_POLICY or REAUTH_POLICY (i.e., timeout policy)",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "BYPASS_POLICY or CLIENT_FORWARDING_POLICY (i.e., client forwarding policy)",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "INSPECTION_POLICY (i.e., AppProtection policy)",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "ISOLATION_POLICY (i.e., Isolation policy)",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "REDIRECTION_POLICY (i.e., redirection policy)",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "CAPABILITIES_POLICY (i.e., privileged capabilities policy)",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "CREDENTIAL_POLICY (i.e., privileged credential policy)",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "CLIENTLESS_SESSION_PROTECTION_POLICY (i.e., Browser Protection policy)",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "PRIVILEGED_PORTAL_POLICY (i.e., privileged portal policy)",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Valid values for page and page size parameters.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "text": "For example: /mgmtconfig/v1/admin/customers/217246660302995456/policySet/rules/policyType/INSPECTION_POLICY?page=1&pagesize=1."
    },
